{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stalk the shadows in a medieval roguelike deckbuilder where stealth is your weapon. Pickpocket foes to build a deck of cunning abilities, turning their strengths against them in tactical, turn-based gameplay. Migrate across a wretched kingdom where every run writes a new, grim story of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the environment to your advantage, sneak past deadly patrols to conserve resources, or set up the perfect ambush, turning darkness into your greatest strength.\u00a0Risk getting close to pickpocket enemies for crucial resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842950/extras/c15b8bdb234dcf20016e1323cd155eb3.poster.avif?t=1766434706\" width=766 height=382 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842950/extras/c15b8bdb234dcf20016e1323cd155eb3.webm?t=1766434706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842950/extras/c15b8bdb234dcf20016e1323cd155eb3.mp4?t=1766434706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your abilities are scavenged from the grim territories you cross. Each new area traversed yields new cards\u2014 wicked potions, cunning deception, silent attacks, and wily disguises. Carefully select which abilities to add to your deck to prepare for the growing dangers ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842950/extras/3ad56581f4106ccfc3c9325a1cd85760.poster.avif?t=1766434706\" width=766 height=382 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842950/extras/3ad56581f4106ccfc3c9325a1cd85760.webm?t=1766434706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842950/extras/3ad56581f4106ccfc3c9325a1cd85760.mp4?t=1766434706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The kingdom is a procedurally generated web of decaying roads and forgotten trails. Each stop on your journey presents a choice: face a dangerous elite for a rare reward, seek shelter at a hidden camp, or risk a shortcut through treacherous territory. Every path you take writes a new chapter in your grim story of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842950/extras/afbba5d3b1b8ee49d65c0c63234a2ddd.poster.avif?t=1766434706\" width=766 height=382 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842950/extras/afbba5d3b1b8ee49d65c0c63234a2ddd.webm?t=1766434706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842950/extras/afbba5d3b1b8ee49d65c0c63234a2ddd.mp4?t=1766434706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a host of powerful heirlooms and potent elixirs that fundamentally alter your run. These items might grant passive bonuses that enhance your stealth, add new effects to your cards, or provide a powerful world altering ability. Seek out tactical combinations to ensure your survival on the treacherous journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842950/extras/5995ef0ba86caa91bcdc5a99805a3d24.poster.avif?t=1766434706\" width=766 height=382 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842950/extras/5995ef0ba86caa91bcdc5a99805a3d24.webm?t=1766434706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842950/extras/5995ef0ba86caa91bcdc5a99805a3d24.mp4?t=1766434706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Turn-Based Tactical Stealth Gameplay</u> - Use stealth based moves to navigate unseen. Evade dangerous patrols to conserve strength or position yourself for the perfect turn-based ambush.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Scavenged Deckbuilding</u>\u00a0- \u00a0Forge a unique deck on every run. Acquire new ability cards by conquering territories, mastering the skills of the very foes that stand in your way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Procedurally Generated Maps</u> - Branching paths, grim events, and costly choices. No two journeys through this wretched land are ever the same.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>High-Stakes Thievery</u>\u00a0-<strong>\u00a0</strong>Risk getting close to pickpocket enemies for crucial resources, valuable intel, or temporary advantages. A successful theft can turn the tide, but getting caught is deadly.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3842950?t=1766434706","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3842950?t=1766434706","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842950/8a788c2e2a33de4ff6d8c550b7749b36769e4667/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766434706","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842950/8a788c2e2a33de4ff6d8c550b7749b36769e4667/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766434706","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],